<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>식물 도감 | BOTANICA LAB</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div>
            <h1>BOTANICA LAB</h1>
            <p>YOUR SPACE, YOUR PLANT.</p>
        </div>

        <nav>
            <a href="/">홈</a>
            <a href="/about">브랜드 소개</a>
            <a href="/plants">식물 도감</a>
            <a href="/recommend">식물 추천</a>
            <a href="/care">식물 관리</a>
            <a href="/shop">스토어</a>
            <a href="/contact">문의하기</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <h2>식물 도감</h2>
        <p>BOTANICA LAB이 소개하는 식물들을 만나보세요.</p>
        <section class="plant-list">

        <% plants.forEach(function(plant) { %>
    <article>
        <img src="/images/<%= plant.image %>" alt="<%= plant.name %>">
        <h3><%= plant.name %></h3>
        <p><%= plant.scientific_name %></p>
        <a href="/plants/<%= plant.id %>">상세 정보 보기</a>
    </article>
<% }); %>


        </section>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
